Patch applied to container-service-3.7.2-uq-fat.jar (JS resources inside the jar,
paths below are relative to META-INF/resources/scripts/xnat/plugin/containerService/).
Routes single container launches through the bulklaunch endpoint so every launch
gets a bulk-launch-id and live progress in XNAT's Processing activity panel, and
adds a site-wide container log viewer used by the progress dialog and the
Active Processes banner (templates/screens/workflow_alert.vm override in
manifests/configmap.yaml).

